muse-gadget-xiaozhi
===================

A fork of Meta's Muse Gadget SDK (https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk,
commit 1b56662588c0ea00bdee24b9bcd1835e12848e9a) whose voice backend talks to the
xiaozhi.me service (https://github.com/78/xiaozhi-esp32) instead of Muse.

Not affiliated with, or endorsed by, Meta Platforms, Inc. or the xiaozhi project.
"Muse" names the upstream SDK this is derived from.

